 "brief_title": "A Study to Investigate Effectiveness of Tirzepatide Following Initiation of Ixekizumab in Participants With Active Psoriatic Arthritis and Overweight or Obesity in Clinical Practice (TOGETHER AMPLIFY-PsA)",
 "official_title": "A Phase 4, Prospective, Open-Label, Single-Arm Study to Assess the Effectiveness of Tirzepatide After Initiation of Ixekizumab in Adult Participants With Active Psoriatic Arthritis and Overweight or Obesity in Clinical Practice.",
